WEBVTT

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.440
I can't sleep...

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.840
Then should we talk about something?

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:14.320
If you're going to do girl talk before sleep,
 how about you talk romance?

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.450
Then we'll start with you
since you suggested it, Mile.

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.510
What? Me?

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:19.900
I, uh...

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.450
I've got nothing.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:22.910
What about you, Pauline?

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.120
I'm sorry. I've got nothing, too.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.330
Me neither. That's the end of that.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:28.280
What?

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.640
Why didn't you ask me?

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:31.480
Do you have anything?

00:00:31.990 --> 00:00:33.640
Well... uh...

00:00:33.640 --> 00:00:34.680
No.

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.140
It just means that girls who 
enroll at a place like this

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:39.520
don't have time for that kind of thing.

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:43.080
If a story would be all right, I have one.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:44.890
Sounds good. Let's hear it.

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:48.020
All right. I saw this on TV when I was little.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.000
TV?

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:53.010
No, what I meant was, um...

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.750
Yes. From an imaginary land called 
"Japan," I bring you a wondrous tale.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:59.930
This is <i>Altered Folktales From Japan</i>.

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:02.540
Oh, that sounds like fun!

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:06.130
Once upon a time...

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:12.360
That is how the hero, Peach, 
managed to successfully defeat the ogres.

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.550
And they all lived happily ever after.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:16.500
That was great!

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.270
That's the first time I've heard a 
story where animals were part of a party.

00:01:20.270 --> 00:01:21.880
Tell us more!

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.420
I've already told you more than ten stories.

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:27.310
They're fun! It makes you want to hear more!

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:30.490
I've already told you all 
the ones I remember...

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.360
Oh.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.930
Do you mind if I change genres?

00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.890
Anything's fine, just tell us another!

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.190
The Goblingers are awesome!

00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:43.700
"If a miracle's what we need, 
then we'll make a miracle happen!"

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:47.060
"I will show you... my true power!"

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:49.260
"A life lasts only 50 years!"

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:51.230
What's with the pose?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:55.060
<i>I wonder if they've caught it now...</i>

00:01:55.060 --> 00:02:00.550
<i>That illness that otaku in the world I used 
to live in were particularly susceptible to...</i>

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:02.770
<i>Chuunibyou.</i>

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.020
Didn't I Say to Make My Abilities 
Average in the Next Life?!

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:39.030
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:39.030
<b>Didn't I Say to Make My Graduation Plain and Simple?!</b>

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:41.390
Sorry this happened so suddenly,

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:42.780
but six months have passed.

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:47.180
Mile-san...

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:48.620
Yes?

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.720
We've decided to form a party 
after graduation, and...

00:03:52.720 --> 00:03:54.750
We were wondering if you'd join us, Mile-san.

00:03:55.150 --> 00:03:57.210
Um... I'm sorry.

00:03:57.210 --> 00:04:00.510
I've already promised my roommates.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.510
We thought you might've...

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:04.060
Too bad.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:11.350
<i>Turning down invitations with that 
excuse was Reina-san's idea...</i>

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:15.600
It's... already graduation.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.030
What will you do, Mile-sama?

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.960
My situation is complicated,

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.890
so I think I need to be 
able to live on my own.

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:29.580
Just when we were getting along so well.

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:34.760
Oh, that's right.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:36.290
Where should we have our base?

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:39.250
Our base?

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:44.050
Our base of operations for our 
party after we graduate, of course.

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:45.260
What?

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:48.570
It's not like any of you have 
anywhere specific to go, right?

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:51.600
And considering the way none of you 
like to talk about your families,

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.630
all three of you are in a difficult 
 position for various reasons.

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:56.020
Anyone have any complaints?

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.650
I don't.

00:04:57.910 --> 00:05:01.750
One day, I must return 
to where I was born,

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.140
but for now I'd like to polish 
my magic skills,

00:05:04.140 --> 00:05:05.900
so if I could do that with all of you, then...

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:08.410
Now then, there's only one left.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:12.880
M-M-My situation is really 
super complicated, so...

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:16.770
I'd only cause trouble if I was with you.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.080
And?

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.050
I'm saying I'd only be trouble for you.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.540
I know that. What's the rest?

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.600
The rest?

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.050
If you have no other reasons,
 then it's decided.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.010
Oh, but...

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.260
That's enough! It's decided!

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.770
Besides, you're always telling people 
you promised your roommates, right?

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:38.240
Huh? But, Reina-san, that's because you...

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:40.030
Stop talking.

00:05:40.030 --> 00:05:43.200
We are forming a party!

00:05:43.200 --> 00:05:44.990
The matter is settled!

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:53.910
Honestly!

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:05.560
Listen up. As long as crimson 
blood runs through our veins,

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.640
we will never betray our friends.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:09.890
Our friendship will never be destroyed!

00:06:11.080 --> 00:06:12.370
Yeah!

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:15.500
I'm so hungry...

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.530
Hey! What should we have for lunch?

00:06:17.530 --> 00:06:20.100
Sometimes, it's nice to dig into some meat!

00:06:20.490 --> 00:06:22.230
Squad C. Can I see you a minute?

00:06:22.790 --> 00:06:23.730
Huh?

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.020
What's going on, Principal?

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:34.720
As you seem to be the most skilled 
among the students this semester,

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:36.080
I have a favor to ask!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.780
Oh, no. We're not really...

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.440
Yes, you are!

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:41.750
Talent like yours hasn't been seen 
since this place was founded!

00:06:42.090 --> 00:06:42.900
Huh?

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:47.510
Um, so, what is this favor you wanted?

00:06:47.930 --> 00:06:50.520
This time, it's been decided that at the 
Graduation Certification Mock Battle,

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:54.760
a team representing the 
students will fight B-rank Hunters.

00:06:55.130 --> 00:06:59.240
I see. And you want us to be 
the representatives, right?

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.800
Of course we'll do it!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:02.810
Being a representative would be an honor!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.200
No. It's not just the fight.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.110
I want you to win!

00:07:06.310 --> 00:07:07.320
What?

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.080
I'd heard that the mock battle 
was just a test of skill,

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:13.140
and that who won or lost didn't matter.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.000
That's how it's supposed to be, but...

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:17.700
This time, if we don't win, this school...

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.080
will be shut down!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.830
What?

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:24.590
Our school doesn't produce 
impressive results,

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:27.810
and there have always been people 
who say it's a waste,

00:07:27.810 --> 00:07:32.840
but the other day, an influential noble 
suddenly imposed the condition I just gave you.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.180
Are B rank Hunters really that strong?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.090
Just ten of them can complete
 national-level quests.

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:43.520
To be blunt, for people C rank or lower 
to beat them would take a miracle.

00:07:43.830 --> 00:07:45.610
There's that much of a difference...

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.160
I understand that.

00:07:47.160 --> 00:07:51.320
And the lack of results is 
entirely my responsibility.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.140
But I don't want to let 
them close this school!

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:57.080
All of you, please! I'm begging you!

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:58.660
No, no. We couldn't possibl—

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.260
Leave it to us!

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.540
What?

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.720
This is the day you will
take the final step of

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:12.570
your six-month-long Hunter 
training school curriculum...

00:08:12.570 --> 00:08:14.770
The Graduation Certification Mock Battle.

00:08:14.770 --> 00:08:19.170
Show me all the skills you've 
worked so hard to attain!

00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:25.730
After that, I might have to be like 
the main character in an anime

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.690
and put my life on the line in this fight...

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:29.700
Oh my!

00:08:29.700 --> 00:08:30.480
Huh?

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:34.740
I've missed you, my sweetheart.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.990
What?!

00:08:38.230 --> 00:08:40.740
Wh-Why are you here?

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:48.090
Reina-san and the others said you'd 
been handed off to the military police.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.090
I'm sorry it's so cramped in here.

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:55.680
This is a waiting room prepared just for me.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.930
Seeing a lovely young girl tense with 
anxiety is very stimulating, too.

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:09.520
Hurry up and tell me! Why is the 
boss of a kidnapping ring here?

00:09:09.890 --> 00:09:11.740
I'm quite an influential noble,

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:16.000
so even if the police come, 
I can send them away...

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:19.530
Though even I couldn't prevent my underlings 
from being temporarily taken away.

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:22.370
Power really is useful, don't you think?

00:09:23.240 --> 00:09:27.090
Could it be that you're one who said 
the school should be shut down?

00:09:27.090 --> 00:09:28.250
What a very good guess.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:29.880
Why would you do something like that?

00:09:30.660 --> 00:09:36.260
It's payback for ruining my Thrilling, 
Fully-Loaded, Lovely Girl Harem Plan!

00:09:31.130 --> 00:09:36.260
<b>Thrilling, Fully-Loaded,
Lovely Girl
 Harem Plan♥</b>

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.010
<i>So that was the name of her plan.</i>

00:09:39.480 --> 00:09:40.730
Never mind that!

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:44.640
If you have a grudge against me,
 you should just go after me!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.790
That's no fun at all.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:50.520
But if you insist, I don't 
mind changing the conditions.

00:09:50.760 --> 00:09:51.520
Huh?

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:56.550
If your lot can't beat my 
B-rank Hunters with straight wins,

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:58.660
you will become my property.

00:10:05.480 --> 00:10:06.780
If you're all right with that,

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:09.040
I'll take back the condition 
of closing down the school.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:12.890
<i>I might be able to win, but everyone else...</i>

00:10:13.770 --> 00:10:17.160
<i>But if I could save the school 
in exchange for just me...</i>

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:19.800
All right.

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:25.600
Getting 100 gold coins just for 
beating these fledglings...

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:27.640
The boss is pretty generous.

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:31.230
Still, these guys were lucky last time.

00:10:31.560 --> 00:10:35.480
All the explosives we had in our hideout 
happened to explode for some reason.

00:10:35.750 --> 00:10:38.740
Which means this job 
will be a profitable one.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.690
Huh? Aren't they the kidnappers from before?

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:43.320
Oh! You're right.

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:46.690
I thought the military police 
had taken them away.

00:10:46.690 --> 00:10:48.160
Why are they here?

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:50.530
I don't know, but why not?

00:10:50.530 --> 00:10:53.790
It gives us the chance for a 
rematch from six months ago!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:58.920
Say, everyone! Let's not, "Just go for it!"
 Instead, let's, "Go carefully," okay?

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:00.040
What's that supposed to mean?

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:03.430
Even if we lose here, the school 
won't get shut down, so...

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:04.900
Huh?

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:06.260
What do you mean?

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:10.040
The influential noble withdrew the 
condition of the school's closure.

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:12.350
...is what I heard from the principal.

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:14.240
Really? Is that so.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.480
So you really don't need to—

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:18.680
Even so! This is still a chance for 
us to make a name for ourselves!

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:19.490
What?

00:11:19.810 --> 00:11:21.010
That's true.

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:23.840
And I couldn't stand losing 
to the likes of them twice.

00:11:23.840 --> 00:11:25.730
We aim for victory no 
matter the difficulties!

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.410
Just like the Goblingers!

00:11:27.410 --> 00:11:29.120
What? H-Hang on!

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:30.830
I'm telling you, "Go carefully!"

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.750
It's been a while, kidnapper.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.550
I'm sure you've improved a 
bit in the last six months.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:42.220
I'm planning to go all-out today, 
so this might be over in an instant.

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:45.350
I'll do my very best to persevere, 
so that doesn't happen.

00:11:47.130 --> 00:11:48.610
Don't worry.

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:50.430
Don't talk like it's no big deal.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:52.520
She's up against someone at B rank.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.730
Please observe.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:54.960
Here it comes!

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:58.430
The ultimate technique drilled into my body 
through hellish, blood-soaked training!

00:11:58.430 --> 00:11:59.680
Godspeed Sword!

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:00.990
1.2x normal speed!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.030
Sh-She's fast!

00:12:08.270 --> 00:12:08.790
What?

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:14.580
Thanks to your training, Mile-sama, those 
girls' skills all easily exceed B-rank levels.

00:12:17.680 --> 00:12:19.880
Now that we've warmed up,

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:22.220
how about we both get serious?

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.090
Sh-She's not serious yet?

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:28.280
Godspeed Sword! 1.3x speed!

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.910
Hold it right there! Winner: Mavis!

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.170
Medics!

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.950
But I still had two more levels to go...

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.820
I guess that's all right.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.150
What? What do you think you're doing?

00:12:46.190 --> 00:12:48.030
I look forward to a good match.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:51.130
That last girl really transformed 
herself in the last six months.

00:12:51.130 --> 00:12:54.880
Every once in a while, someone of 
unprecedented talent appears in our world.

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.010
But there aren't very many of them.

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:59.170
Seems I drew the short straw with you.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:02.300
I apologize if I'm not able to 
live up to your expectations.

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.720
The others don't look like 
anything special either.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:09.220
It may call itself the Hunter Prep School,
 but letting kids in...

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.220
I guess its standards have dropped?

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.920
It seems like those kids would get 
annihilated the first time they got sent out.

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:18.230
Still, if they tried to just join a party,
 they'd only hold them back.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.480
Please stop that.

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:20.730
Huh?

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:23.650
You can say whatever you like about me.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:26.300
If I think of you as a troublesome customer,
 it doesn't bother me at all.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:31.620
But I will not tolerate any 
insult to my dear friends.

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:35.640
Huh? I'm just calling it like I see it.

00:13:35.640 --> 00:13:38.030
They're both pipsqueaks 
with thin little bodies.

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:39.540
The very definition of 
small-fry cannon fodder—

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.810
I told you, I will tolerate none of that!

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.290
What? A mage flinging 
herself into close combat?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.040
Rage, flames!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.720
Into a burning fireball, to scorch 
the enemy before me to nothing!

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.390
Fireball!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.110
Oh, dear. That was a direct hit, wasn't it?

00:14:01.110 --> 00:14:02.230
Pauline-san!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.640
With those burns, you can't 
keep fighting, can you?

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:07.110
Just give up now.

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:10.670
Dull the sense of pain. 
Regenerate muscle tissue.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:13.320
Repair arteries and veins. 
Restore skin tissue.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.440
Mega Heal!

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:21.550
You're kidding me!

00:14:21.550 --> 00:14:24.580
Even my teacher couldn't 
use that legendary healing magic!

00:14:24.580 --> 00:14:26.800
How can a little girl like you possibly...

00:14:27.160 --> 00:14:29.760
You can attack me as much as you'd like.

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:35.430
I'll heal it all, then bring this staff down on 
the head of the person who insulted my friends.

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.310
I... I give! I surrender!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.940
Winner: Pauline!

00:14:43.950 --> 00:14:46.110
Wh-What's going on?

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:47.960
That was so scary!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.220
You did good!

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:52.210
<i>Th-The way Pauline-san fights is terrifying!</i>

00:14:52.210 --> 00:14:53.660
<i>It's too scary!</i>

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:55.740
My turn next.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:15:00.320
<i>What's with those last two?</i>

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:03.250
<i>Could this one have increased 
her abilities, too?</i>

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.960
<i>This old man... He seems like he's 
got both skills and experience,</i>

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:09.510
<i>so why did he turn to evil deeds?</i>

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:12.880
<i>Oh! Could it be that he needs to 
earn money, even dirty money,</i>

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:14.640
<i>to support lots of children?</i>

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:17.310
Do you have a family?

00:15:18.700 --> 00:15:20.680
You're so arrogantly 
certain you can beat me,

00:15:20.680 --> 00:15:22.940
you're worried about the 
family I'll leave behind?

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:24.950
Roaring flames of ultimate fire!

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:27.280
Enshroud and burn my enemy to ash!

00:15:27.960 --> 00:15:30.360
Stop! That magic will kill her!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.530
Hellfire!

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:38.290
Did you see that? My greatest spell.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.960
Put out those flames now!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.500
No need for that.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:45.040
What?

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:48.240
I'm best at fire magic,

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:51.140
but lately, I've gotten really 
good at ice magic, too.

00:15:51.630 --> 00:15:54.090
Now, it's my turn!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.260
Roaring flames of ultimate fire!

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:58.280
Enshroud and burn my enemy to ash!

00:15:58.280 --> 00:15:59.040
Hellfi—

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.670
W-W-Wait!

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.850
I don't have magic to counter that!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.020
I'll die!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.770
I give up! I surrender!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:08.900
What? You're the one who used 
it in the first place.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:09.900
No fair.

00:16:10.140 --> 00:16:11.570
Winner: Reina!

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.670
Just what you'd expect from Reina.

00:16:16.670 --> 00:16:17.960
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

00:16:17.960 --> 00:16:20.440
<i>No one's gotten injured. They're all fine.</i>

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:21.360
Mile!

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:22.210
Yes?

00:16:22.430 --> 00:16:25.100
You're the last one. 
Go get us a perfect victory!

00:16:27.110 --> 00:16:31.090
<i>Now, I just need to win in a way that doesn't 
make me stand out and end all of this quietly.</i>

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.560
Huh?

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:42.940
I'm not really sure what's going on,
 but did I just win by default?

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:44.580
<i>That's lucky!</i>

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:47.340
<i>This is the least flashy way to win, right?</i>

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.120
I won't let that happen.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:49.610
Huh?

00:16:52.100 --> 00:16:53.060
Thump.

00:16:57.120 --> 00:16:59.830
I will fight you in his place.

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:01.080
Huh?

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:04.080
That's... the boss behind 
the kidnappings, right?

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.250
Oh! You're right!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.650
If I win, you will comply with 
the conditions we set earlier.

00:17:11.190 --> 00:17:14.170
By the way, I used to be an A-rank Hunter.

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:15.260
What?

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:19.010
It's usually my policy to cherish 
pretty little girls,

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:22.430
but seeing a face contorted in pain might 
not be so bad once in a while.

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.230
Huh?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:32.360
She's strong!

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:35.240
So fast!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.790
<i>What's with her physical abilities?</i>

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:54.190
<i>Her movement isn't refined at all, and yet</i>

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.860
<i>it's taking everything I have to manage her?</i>

00:17:57.810 --> 00:17:58.890
<i>I have no choice.</i>

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:02.140
I'll let you see a skill I've been 
saving for a special occasion.

00:18:02.760 --> 00:18:05.920
If I use this, you'll 
end up quite battered,

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:08.260
so I'd really rather not, but...

00:18:08.260 --> 00:18:09.900
You won't want to give up, will you?

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:13.650
After all, you embody all of my ideals...

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:15.530
in that modest chest of yours!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:20.240
You said it again, didn't you?

00:18:20.610 --> 00:18:21.860
What? This is—

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:24.560
It's the same as that other time.

00:18:25.310 --> 00:18:28.620
It couldn't be... <i>You</i> caused that explosion?

00:18:29.040 --> 00:18:33.580
Didn't I say that I'm still growing?!

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:35.050
Oh no!

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:50.560
Please concede this match.

00:18:52.660 --> 00:18:54.400
I-I give up!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.890
And I'll confess to all 
the bad things I've done!

00:18:57.890 --> 00:18:59.450
Please forgive me!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.510
You were splendid!

00:19:05.510 --> 00:19:09.330
Forget saving the school 
from getting closed down.

00:19:09.330 --> 00:19:11.500
You uncovered the crimes of a corrupt noble!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.960
Our reputation with His Majesty and 
those allied with him is skyrocketing!

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:18.050
I've been promised a budget 
increase starting next year!

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:20.130
Mavis-kun!

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:21.620
Yes?

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:25.660
I'm from the Emerald Gale.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.140
Will you join us?

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:27.770
What?

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:28.830
Pauline!

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:31.180
Come join the Scorching Thunder!

00:19:31.180 --> 00:19:34.360
We've got a lot of rowdy types, 
so we're always getting injured.

00:19:34.880 --> 00:19:35.830
Reina!

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.600
Won't you join us in the Glittering Dusk?

00:19:38.600 --> 00:19:40.740
Most of us are mages.

00:19:42.530 --> 00:19:43.270
Mile!

00:19:44.090 --> 00:19:47.340
Come join my Roaring Mithrils. 
You'd be greatly welcome.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:48.960
What's this?

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:52.840
The Roaring Mithrils are among the 
highest-rated parties, even among B ranks!

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.820
If you study hard under 
them from your young age,

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:57.270
even S rank wouldn't be out of reach!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:19:59.550
You'd be the pride of my school!

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:01.170
I'm sorry, I have to decline.

00:20:02.640 --> 00:20:05.490
I promised my roommates.

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:07.600
We have to decline, too!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.430
Because we promised our roommates!

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.940
Are we really doing this?

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.940
I don't know why we wouldn't!

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:16.110
Of course!

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.230
Let's do it!

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:24.160
We may have been born in 
different places and times!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.660
But we are as close as family!

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:29.160
We have become friends who 
will walk the same path!

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:32.910
And even if one day our paths should part...

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:36.500
As long as crimson blood 
flows through my veins...

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.130
Our friendship will never die!

00:20:39.540 --> 00:20:42.820
We four are friends bound in spirit!

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:43.880
And we are...

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:45.830
The Crimson Vow!

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:52.180
We nailed it.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.810
This is the best feeling!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.100
I think I could get addicted to this!

00:21:01.840 --> 00:21:05.150
<i>With all of this, we'll keep attracting 
attention even after graduation...</i>

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.700
Huh? Where's Pauline-san?

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.360
One is five silver coins.

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:16.290
If you get all four, we'll give you a 
steep discount at one small gold coin!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:17.820
Give me a Reina-chan!

00:21:17.820 --> 00:21:20.000
Can I have one Mavis-oneesama?

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.360
I want a Mile-chan!

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:22.860
Three of Pauline-chan!

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:24.340
Three full sets!

00:21:24.590 --> 00:21:26.140
Wh-Wh-What is all this?

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:28.160
Is it WonFes? Are we at WonFes?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:31.320
The dolls you make all 
the time caught her eye.

00:21:31.320 --> 00:21:33.590
She said she used those as 
prototypes and mass produced them.

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:36.350
Now you mention it, 
she did ask to borrow them...

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:39.990
<i>After reincarnating into another world, 
I'm getting my WonFes debut?</i>

00:21:39.990 --> 00:21:43.740
She said it's to build up funds for the 
Crimson Vow's activities after graduation.

00:21:43.740 --> 00:21:45.860
That's our financial affairs officer for you!

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:47.490
Oh! It's Reina-chan!

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:49.120
Mavis-oneesama!

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.240
Mile-chan!

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.870
Autograph this!

00:21:51.870 --> 00:21:53.040
I want a handshake!

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:55.220
I was wrong about WonFes!

00:21:55.220 --> 00:21:57.970
This is more like they came to meet idols!

00:21:57.970 --> 00:21:59.690
No, no! Don't give up!

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:01.700
In this, my second life,

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:05.170
I will find super average, 
completely normal happiness!

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:08.320
I will find it!
